    "body": "looks like I overlooked what a [namespace object](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-namespace-object) is, and I don't think it can be what is returned from `console.context()` here. So I guess it should return some kind of `Console/Context/ConsoleInstance` interface, that hopefully we can then reuse for the definition of the `console` namespace?",
