    "body": "I'm happy to keep the design discussion in https://github.com/whatwg/console/issues/193, since that's where most of it has been so far. Just wanted to point out that given https://github.com/whatwg/console/issues/193#issuecomment-2952919359, I think we need to think harder about how to specify the interaction between internal state like the group stack and the notion of multiple console objects (whether they come from different documents, or the same document via `.context()`).",
