    "body": "> > So I guess it should return some kind of Console/Context/ConsoleInstance interface, that hopefully we can then reuse for the definition of the console namespace?\r\n> \r\n> What does Chromium do? Maybe @bmeurer knows?\r\n\r\nThat's basically what Chromium does, see [`builtins-context.cc`](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:v8/src/builtins/builtins-console.cc;l=264-316;drc=5e74ac5d42bce00b534d992272e7fa09b53b300f).",
